==English==

===Etymology===
{{m|en|out}} + {{m|en|reach}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|noun}} {{enPR|outʹrēch}}, {{IPA|/ˈaʊtɹiːtʃ/|lang=en}}
* {{sense|verb}} {{enPR|out-rēchʹ}}, {{IPA|/aʊtˈɹiːtʃ/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|iːtʃ|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|es}}

# The act of [[reach out|reaching out]].
# The [[extent]] or [[length]] of one's [[reach]].
# The act or practice of visiting and providing services (of a [[charity]], [[church]], or other organization) to people who might not otherwise have access to those services.

